</li></ul></div></section>";
const T2 = "<section class=\"svc-intro mm-intro\"><div class=\"mm-marco\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Motorized Louvered Roof Installation Experts in <span class=\"mm-rot\">Florida</span></h2><p class=\"mm-p\">We specialize in louvered roof installation across North &amp; South Florida, building motorized bioclimatic systems that allow homeowners to fully control sunlight, ventilation, and rain protection for true year-round outdoor comfort.</p><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/about\">More About Us<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"mm-gal\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\"><span class=\"mm-rot\">Louvered Roof</span> Gallery</h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Florida louvered roof systems installed by licensed contractors — elegant and engineered.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/gallery\">Project Gallery<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-fotos\"><div class=\"mm-mosaico mm-mosaico--6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-blades-motor-solar-sensor-top-view-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Top of a white louvered roof showing blades, motors and a small solar panel beside a modern home\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-blades-motor-solar-sensor-top-view-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Top of a white louvered roof showing blades, motors and a small solar panel beside a modern home\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-pergola-finished-condo-terrace-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Finished white louvered pergola casting striped shade on a wood-look terrace.\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-pergola-finished-condo-terrace-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Finished white louvered pergola casting striped shade on a wood-look terrace.\" width=\"1125\" height=\"838\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-red-led-lighting-dusk-patio-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: White louvered roof lit with red LED lights over a travertine patio with wicker seating at dusk\"><img src=\"/images/banco/louvered/louvered-roof-red-led-lighting-dusk-patio-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"White louvered roof lit with red LED lights over a travertine patio with wicker seating at dusk\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-7/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-07.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Black aluminum louvered roof system covering seating area by water, designed for durability and weather resistance.\"><img src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-7/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Black aluminum louvered roof system covering seating area by water, designed for durability and weather resistance.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-6/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-06.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Motorized louvered roof installed on modern property, providing adjustable sunlight control and contemporary outdoor design.\"><img src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-6/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Motorized louvered roof installed on modern property, providing adjustable sunlight control and contemporary outdoor design.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"839\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-4/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-04.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Modern aluminum louvered roof attached to luxury home, offering shade, ventilation, and sleek outdoor coverage.\"><img src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-4/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Modern aluminum louvered roof attached to luxury home, offering shade, ventilation, and sleek outdoor coverage.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico-resto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-3/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-03.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Adjustable louvered roof panels allowing airflow and rain protection, ideal for poolside patios in South Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-3/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-03.jpg\" alt=\"Adjustable louvered roof panels allowing airflow and rain protection, ideal for poolside patios in South Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-2/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-02.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: White motorized louvered roof system covering outdoor dining area, designed for sun control and modern backyard living in Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-2/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-02.jpg\" alt=\"White motorized louvered roof system covering outdoor dining area, designed for sun control and modern backyard living in Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-1/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-01.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Motorized louvered roof installed over patio, providing adjustable shade, ventilation, and weather protection in Florida homes.\"><img src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-1/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-01.jpg\" alt=\"Motorized louvered roof installed over patio, providing adjustable shade, ventilation, and weather protection in Florida homes.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-5/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom patio cover with integrated LED lighting and motorized louvers for day and night outdoor comfort in Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-5/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Custom patio cover with integrated LED lighting and motorized louvers for day and night outdoor comfort in Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"1250\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Louvered Roof Install <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our licensed contractors design, permit, and install motorized louvered roof systems engineered for Florida wind-load standards and weather requirements.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><ol class=\"mm-pasos\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Climate Adaptation &amp; System Selection</h3><p>Assessment of Florida climate demands (humidity, salt air, wind loads) and selection of bioclimatic system best suited to property conditions. We review motorized vs. manual louver operation.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Engineering Design &amp; Customization</h3><p>Detailed system design with wind-load calculations, louver angle optimization for seasonal sun management, and drainage system engineering. 3D renderings show operational benefits.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Structural &amp; Electrical Permitting</h3><p>Engineering permits for roof installation, electrical permits for motorization systems (if included), and ARB approvals. HVHZ compliance verification for high-wind zones.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Professional Installation &amp; Commissioning</h3><p>Complete installation including structural anchoring, motorization systems testing, smart control integration, and performance verification. Full operational training provided.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Motorized Louvered Roof Design &amp; Installation Services</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We design and install motorized louvered roof systems in North &amp; South Florida, offering adjustable shade and rain protection year-round.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Motorized &amp; Manual Louvers</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We build extruded aluminum louvered roofs that rotate closed against rain and open for airflow. We engineer every frame to Florida Building Code wind loads, with High-Velocity Hurricane Zone product approval where Broward requires it. Powder-coated finishes and stainless fasteners resist salt air and UV.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Motorized Louvered Roof Installation</dt><dd>South Florida contractors install motorized aluminum louvered roofs with integrated gutters and rain sensors</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Manual Adjustable Louver Builders</dt><dd>Builders construct manual louvered roofs that tilt for sun control and ventilation</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Automation, Lighting, Fans</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Rain sensors close the louvers on their own when a storm moves in, so the furniture underneath stays dry. We run low-voltage wiring inside the beams for LED lighting, ceiling fans, and motorized screens, and a licensed electrician ties the wet-rated fixtures into your panel.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Smart Sensor Roof Integration</dt><dd>Installers add rain sensors and automation to louvered roofs for hands‑free protection</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>LED Lighting &amp; Fan Installation</dt><dd>Contractors integrate LED lights, ceiling fans, and privacy screens into louvered roof systems</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Layouts, Finishes, Approvals</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Post spacing, beam spans, and blade direction all change with your roof line, so we draw each layout to the house you already have. Wood-grain aluminum reads like cypress and will not rot in Florida humidity, which is why HOA architectural boards clear it when real timber gets rejected.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Layout &amp; Design Services</dt><dd>Designers create 3D layouts and plans to tailor louvered roofs to home spaces</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Wood‑Look Aluminum Finish Installation</dt><dd>Builders offer wood‑grain aluminum finishes for louvered roofs, blending with residential exteriors</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>HOA &amp; Permit Processing</dt><dd>Professionals handle HOA approvals and city permits for louvered roof construction</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Ongoing Service &amp; Repairs</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Louvers ride on gearboxes and pivot bearings that collect salt, pollen, and sand. We clean the tracks, flush the integrated gutters, re-torque hardware, and swap worn motors so the roof still closes when the afternoon storm arrives. After hurricane season we check the blades and seals.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Seasonal Maintenance &amp; Repair</dt><dd>Contractors provide maintenance and repair services to keep louvered roofs operating smoothly</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/images/motorized-louvered-roof-9/motorized-louvered-roof-installers-florida-09.jpg\" alt=\"Louvered roof with the slats open above patio loungers\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"02 / 04\" data-t=\"Automation, Lighting, Fans\"></div></figure></div></section>";
const T4 = "<section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Louvered Roof System <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about motorized louvered roof system installation in Florida? Our licensed outdoor living specialists answer your top questions here.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How do motorized louvered roofs work in Florida weather?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Motorized louvers tilt open to allow full airflow and natural light or close completely to create a waterproof overhead shelter, controlled by remote or smartphone app. This flexibility lets Florida homeowners enjoy their outdoor spaces through intense heat, afternoon storms, and cool winter evenings alike.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are louvered roof systems hurricane-rated in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Louvered roof systems use reinforced extruded aluminum and marine-grade stainless steel hardware, engineered to withstand Florida's high winds. Our systems carry wind-load engineering documentation and are installed to meet local building codes — including HVHZ requirements where applicable in South Florida.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can lighting and fans be added to a louvered roof?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Motorized louvered roof systems can integrate recessed LED lighting, ceiling fans, and radiant heating elements directly into the structure. Electrical work is coordinated during installation, and all additions are permitted through local Florida building departments and HOA architectural review boards where required.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>What color options are available for louvered roofs?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Louvered roof systems are available in a wide range of powder-coated aluminum finishes, including neutral tones and custom colors to complement your home's exterior trim or fence lines. Our team provides color samples and design consultation to ensure seamless integration with your Florida home's architecture and HOA requirements.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How do I properly maintain outdoor installations?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Simply rinse the louvers periodically to remove dust and debris. The powder-coated aluminum finish resists rust, peeling, and UV fading in Florida's coastal and inland climates. Unlike wood or canvas structures, motorized louvered roof systems require no seasonal resealing, repainting, or fabric replacement — a genuinely low-maintenance investment.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-fa