const SEO = {"meta":{"og:title":"Motorized Louvered Roof System Builders & Installation in Florida","og:description":"Motorized louvered roof system installation by certified contractors in North & South Florida. Adjustable shade, rain protection, and durability.","og:image":"/images/obra/og/motorized-louvered-roof-systems-in-north-south-florida.jpg","twitter:title":"Motorized Louvered Roof System Builders & Installation in Florida","twitter:description":"Motorized louvered roof system installation by certified contractors in North & South Florida. Adjustable shade, rain protection, and durability.","twitter:image":"/images/obra/og/motorized-louvered-roof-systems-in-north-south-florida.jpg","og:type":"website","twitter:card":"summary_large_image"},"jsonLd":[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","about":{"@type":"Service","areaServed":[{"@type":"State","name":"Florida"}],"description":"We specialize in louvered roof installation across North &amp; South Florida, building motorized bioclimatic systems that allow homeowners to fully control sunlight, ventilation, and rain protection for true year-round outdoor comfort.","image":"/images/obra/obra-033/louvered-roof-white-large-span-travertine-patio-florida-heroe.avif","name":"Louvered Roof Systems","provider":{"@id":"https://www.mrandmrsoutdoorliving.com/#negocio","@type":"Organization","name":"Mr & Mrs Outdoor Living"},"serviceType":"Motorized Louvered Roof Design & Installation","url":"https://www.mrandmrsoutdoorliving.com/services/louvered-roofs"},"dateModified":"2026-05-18T19:55:49.094Z","datePublished":"2026-05-18T19:52:59.092Z","description":"Motorized louvered roof system installation by certified contractors in North &amp; South Florida. Adjustable shade, rain protection, and durability.","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Motorized louvers tilt open to allow full airflow and natural light or close completely to create a waterproof overhead shelter, controlled by remote or smartphone app. This flexibility lets Florida homeowners enjoy their outdoor spaces through intense heat, afternoon storms, and cool winter evenings alike."},"name":"How do motorized louvered roofs work in Florida weather?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Louvered roof systems use reinforced extruded aluminum and marine-grade stainless steel hardware, engineered to withstand Florida&#39;s high winds. Our systems carry wind-load engineering documentation and are installed to meet local building codes — including HVHZ requirements where applicable in South Florida."},"name":"Are louvered roof systems hurricane-rated in Florida?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Motorized louvered roof systems can integrate recessed LED lighting, ceiling fans, and radiant heating elements directly into the structure. Electrical work is coordinated during installation, and all additions are permitted through local Florida building departments and HOA architectural review boards where required."},"name":"Can lighting and fans be added to a louvered roof?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Louvered roof systems are available in a wide range of powder-coated aluminum finishes, including neutral tones and custom colors to complement your home&#39;s exterior trim or fence lines. Our team provides color samples and design consultation to ensure seamless integration with your Florida home&#39;s architecture and HOA requirements."},"name":"What color options are available for louvered roofs?"},{"@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Simply rinse the louvers periodically to remove dust and debris. The powder-coated aluminum finish resists rust, peeling, and UV fading in Florida&#39;s coastal and inland climates. Unlike wood or canvas structures, motorized louvered roof systems require no seasonal resealing, repainting, or fabric replacement — a genuinely low-maintenance investment."},"name":"louvered"}]},"name":"Louvered Roof Systems","url":"/services/louvered-roofs"}]};
